text = "[center]Enter - start wave
Notes:
A - Water note
S - Fire note
D - Earth note
F - Wind note
J - Cryo note
K - Oil note
L - Lightning note 
Notes make combinations
Left click on cat in bottom right
corner to place it on map
Assign it a sequence up to 5 notes
You can also attack (it costs mana!)[center]

Clear dogs to win!"
fit_content = true

